Dispatch_ready can be achieved via actions: mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready (for origin) or mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready (for destination) or finalize_candidate_direct, finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation, finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation (these set dispatch_ready). Also there is action mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready that set dispatch_ready for origin/destination availabilities.

