- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready parameters ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?transport_leg - transport_leg. Precondition: origin_availability_locked ?origin_availability, origin_availability_confirmed ?origin_availability, transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg, transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg, not (dispatch_ready ?origin_availability). Effect: dispatch_ready ?origin_availability.

